{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling, fast-paced climbing game where players unlock different boons and choose diverse paths to ascend each climb. Control a character in the form of a ball and unlock permanent upgrades to enhance your gameplay. Navigate past various traps as you face the constant risk of falling back to the start.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Climbing Mechanics:</strong> Master momentum-based movement to scale handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression:</strong> Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> (e.g., double jumps, speed boosts, or wall jumps) to tackle increasingly difficult climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Choose between multiple paths\u2014some safe but slow, others laden with traps but offering unique power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hazards:</strong> Dodge spinning traps, collapsing platforms, laser turrets, and environmental hazards that punish careless moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> One wrong move could send you tumbling\u2026 but the thrill of the climb will keep you coming back!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Skyport of Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483330/f719f7ce34d9a174fa3ff26a904c2828a0c78076.jpg"},{"name":"Ministry of Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483330/701e6595fbc05777329275d2c11273c745057f20.jpg"},{"name":"Olympus Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483330/fdbfcbe61b936b7c3d2c925297644db02d8e3f7b.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483330/8f8f5b458184d16eb5d180df0bd6cef025358292.